{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/e/74e8d1024431dbf91b0164f3f993cd2b01b47b4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"11\" /> are the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root\">roots</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdcfce0960a613ca224f36cba8eba40a5b3f4bc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2kx+2m=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/d/1cdca957768dce71cf20104eca92b58843644a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x_1},\\frac{1}{x_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"50\" height=\"39\" /> are the roots of the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/6/fd6d9327fd3b0fb9ddbd5f868a3caf6a5f331ade.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ x^2-2k^2x+2m^2=0\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ x^2-\\frac{k}{m}x+\\frac{1}{2m}=0\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ x^2-\\frac{m}{k}x+\\frac{1}{2m}=0\\\\ \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2mx^2-kx+1=0\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2kx^2-2mx+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"639\" height=\"58\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%E2%80%99s_Formulae&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Vieta’s Formulae (page does not exist)\">Vieta’s</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/066240af9a38e6329825cb6acca781616ad6d864.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 + x_2 = 2k,\\ x_1 \\cdot x_2 = 2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"212\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The equation with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44ab4f541e7969ff5ed0bac2b344f3392392fc9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{x_1}, \\frac{1}{x_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"84\" height=\"39\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/5/185521152c0eeee3946332d5e1300741a6efe209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = \\left(x - \\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)\\left(x - \\frac{1}{x_2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"194\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/9/af9ae3531c083497faab0bee588d515e5f9c6eef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= x^2 - \\left(\\frac{1}{x_1} + \\frac{1}{x_2}\\right) + \\frac{1}{x_1x_2} = x^2 - \\left(\\frac{x_1 + x_2}{x_1x_2}\\right) + \\frac{1}{x_1x_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"429\" height=\"45\" />. Substituting from above, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/2/0b2682e5cea702b19415131a64ae964c656d2b4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - \\frac{k}{m}x + \\frac{1}{2m}= 0 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"220\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=